AB  - With the arrival of a learning society, information networking has brought about a fundamental change in the way of knowledge dissemination. It has made modern education methods break away from restrictions in time and space. online learning platform (OLP) learning platform plays an increasingly important role in China's education and has gradually become a widely accepted and adopted learning method. Therefore, based on data mining and intelligent algorithms, this paper conducts an in-depth study on the learning platform (LP) of basic courses for college design majors. This paper first introduces the data processing method and resource recommendation algorithm design, then analyzes the functional requirements of the LP and designs the overall architecture of the platform and the learning resource recommendation system, and finally analyzes the use of the LP and the learning resource recommendation system and draws the corresponding conclusions. The research results show that the LP and learning resource recommendation system meet the needs of users for basic course learning. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
