AB  - This paper proposes a design solution for a distributed machine learning platform based on Apache Spark and expounds on its advantages in specific application scenarios. Through Spark's distributed computing framework, the platform realizes efficient machine learning model training and prediction. The paper details the platform's overall architecture, core components, and model implementation methods. We also validate the platform's efficiency and scalability in processing large-scale data through a product recommendation system example. Research indicates that compared to standalone systems, this Spark-based machine learning platform can significantly shorten model training time and support stream data processing. This study offers a reliable and scalable machine learning implementation solution in a big data environment. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
