AB  - ChooseYourCourse"is a system that aggregates various educational materials and helps the user with their selection for self-study. The Knowledge Base of this system contains materials of various formats: video courses, textbooks and scientific articles. This paper is devoted to the description of the module for processing the Knowledge Base of the system ChooseYourCourse. The article describes the architecture of the module and its components. An algorithm for the classification of education materials has been developed in accordance with the GRNTI classifier. An algorithm for ranking courses relative to a given category has also been developed. This algorithm constructs the order of studying materials on the selected topic. © 2023 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.
